{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_ae060a3886de4d1a-1383\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>很多人都喜歡吃芋頭炆鴨，肥媽在《在家宴客50道菜》中，就教大家如何簡單在家製作這道經典名菜，隨時想吃都能吃到！肥媽更特別公開了獨門的醬汁黃金比例，而且鴨件完全不需要預先醃製，省時又便利！</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_ae060a3886de4d1a-1383\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b49944e7-cb63-486c-8196-7db1469c7c73.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026xG6MhRjFJ51789636534.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b49944e7-cb63-486c-8196-7db1469c7c73.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">主要食材：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><p id=\"p-rc_ae060a3886de4d1a-1384\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !impor